表征决定了系统能够顺利改变什么。

621
00:40:29,942 --> 00:40:35,622
Pixels preserve direct detail, latents compress visual structure, and tokens describe sequences and relations.
像素保留直接细节，潜伏压缩视觉结构，标记描述序列和关系。

622
00:40:35,622 --> 00:40:40,933
