每种选择都会产生不同的优势、盲点以及运动和控制成本。

623
00:40:40,933 --> 00:40:46,761
Read the slide as a set of decisions: 1, Pixels: direct but expensive;
将幻灯片视为一组决策： 1、像素：直接但昂贵；

624
00:40:46,761 --> 00:40:52,478
2, Latents: compressed visual factors; 3, Tokens: sequences that models can predict.
2、Latents：压缩视觉因素； 3、Tokens：模型可以预测的序列。

