631
00:41:17,463 --> 00:41:22,004
Now we turn to Latent space is less a library than a landscape.
现在我们转向潜在空间，与其说是图书馆，不如说是风景。

632
00:41:22,004 --> 00:41:24,449
This image gives us a useful metaphor.
这个图像给了我们一个有用的比喻。

633
00:41:24,449 --> 00:41:27,593
A library suggests fixed items waiting to be retrieved.
图书馆建议等待检索的固定项目。

634
00:41:27,593 --> 00:41:31,819
A landscape suggests continuous movement, neighborhoods, paths, and inaccessible regions.
景观暗示着连续的运动、社区、路径和难以到达的区域。

635
00:41:31,819 --> 00:41:36,360
A latent representation does not usually store a complete image at each point.
潜在表示通常不会在每个点存储完整的图像。

636
00:41:36,360 --> 00:41:40,203
It organizes learned features so that the model can traverse combinations.
它组织学习到的特征，以便模型可以遍历组合。

637
00:41:40,203 --> 00:41:44,045
Prompting is therefore not a database query with one correct result.
因此，提示并不是具有正确结果的数据库查询。

638
00:41:44,045 --> 00:41:46,840
It is an act of navigation under uncertainty.
这是一种在不确定性下的航行行为。

639
00:41:46,840 --> 00:41:52,603
Seed, conditioning, guidance, reference images, masks, and sampling steps all influence the route.
种子、调节、引导、参考图像、掩模和采样步骤都会影响路线。

640
00:41:52,603 --> 00:41:57,494
