652
00:42:37,176 --> 00:42:39,272
These are not independent checklist items.
这些不是独立的清单项目。

653
00:42:39,272 --> 00:42:42,416
Their value comes from how they work together and
他们的价值来自于他们的合作方式以及

654
00:42:42,416 --> 00:42:46,258
from whether the resulting choice can be observed in the artifact.
从是否可以在作品中观察到最终的选择。

655
