这为我们在创造性判断和技术控制之间架起了一座实用的桥梁。

1586
01:47:15,270 --> 01:47:19,349
Now we turn to A world model predicts what happens next under action.
现在我们转向一个世界模型来预测接下来会发生什么。

1587
01:47:19,349 --> 01:47:23,647
A video generator can produce plausible motion without representing a stable, actionable world.
视频生成器可以产生合理的运动，而不代表稳定的、可操作的世界。

1588
01:47:23,647 --> 01:47:28,039
A world model aims to predict how a state changes under actions or conditions.
世界模型旨在预测状态在行动或条件下如何变化。

1589
01:47:28,039 --> 01:47:30,863
The stronger claim is not “it makes video” but
更强有力的主张不是“它制作视频”，而是

1590
01:47:30,863 --> 01:47:34,848
“it supports consequence. ” If I turn left, the environment changes consistently.
“它支持后果。”如果我向左转，环境就会不断变化。

1591
01:47:34,848 --> 01:47:37,891
If I pick up an object, its state persists.
如果我拿起一个物体，它的状态就会持续存在。

1592
01:47:37,891 --> 01:47:41,028
This is difficult because visual plausibility can hide causal weakness.
这很困难，因为视觉上的合理性可能会掩盖因果弱点。

1593
01:47:41,028 --> 01:47:45,546
A system may generate a convincing few seconds while forgetting objects, violating geometry,
系统可能会在忘记物体、违反几何形状、

1594
01:47:45,546 --> 01:47:47,743
or responding inconsistently to the same action.
或对同一动作的反应不一致。

1595
01:47:47,743 --> 01:47:51,413
We should therefore treat “world model” as a hypothesis to test,
因此，我们应该把“世界模型”当作一个假设来检验，

1596
01:47:51,413 --> 01:47:53,296
not a marketing label to repeat.
不是一个需要重复的营销标签。

1597
01:47:53,296 --> 01:47:58,253
For artists, even imperfect world models open new forms: explorable cinema, responsive installations,
对于艺术家来说，即使不完美的世界模型也能开启新的形式：可探索的电影、响应式装置、

1598
01:47:58,253 --> 01:48:01,610
characters that improvise, and environments that change with audience behavior.
即兴创作的角色，以及随观众行为而变化的环境。

1599
01:48:01,610 --> 01:48:04,748
The aesthetic question becomes how much consistency the work needs.
审美问题变成了作品需要多少一致性。

1600
01:48:04,748 --> 01:48:09,046
A dream world may productively mutate; a training simulation may require strict reliability.
梦想世界可能会发生富有成效的变异；训练模拟可能需要严格的可靠性。

1601
01:48:09,046 --> 01:48:11,870
A world model predicts what happens next under action.
世界模型可以预测接下来会发生什么。

